# ============================================================================
# Cloudflare Pages — _redirects
# Format:  <from>  <to>  <status>
#   - first match wins; put specific rules before broad ones
#   - 301 = permanent, 302 = temporary, 200 = rewrite (proxy, no URL change)
# These are PLACEHOLDERS — edit to match real launch decisions.
# ============================================================================

# --- Canonicalize legacy / alternate paths to their real routes ------------
# Trailing-slash and common aliases -> canonical singular routes.
/cocktails/*   /catalog            301
/drink/:slug   /cocktail/:slug     301
/hub/:slug     /collection/:slug   301

# --- Vanity / marketing shortlinks -----------------------------------------
/discord       https://example.com/REPLACE-ME   302
/newsletter    /account                          302

# NOTE: do NOT add a catch-all /* -> /index.html rewrite here. This is a
# static multi-page export (one HTML file per route); a catch-all would mask
# real 404s. Unknown paths are served by dist/404.html (see finalize-export.mjs).
